1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:13,120
Of all the things at my university, what impresses me most is not the modern buildings or the beautiful scenery, but the dedication of our teachers to their students.
在我们大学的所有事物中，最令我印象深刻的不是现代化的建筑，也不是美丽的风景，而是老师们对学生的全心付出。

2
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:16,100
I noticed this in my very first week.
我在入学的第一周就注意到了这一点。

3
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:23,000
In my calculus class, I could not follow a difficult proof, so I emailed the teacher late that evening.
在微积分课上，我没能听懂一个很难的证明，于是当天深夜给老师发了邮件。

4
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:29,950
To my surprise, she replied within an hour and offered to explain it again after class the next day.
令我惊讶的是，她不到一小时就回复了，还主动提出第二天课后再给我讲一遍。

5
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:33,640
Later I found out that she was far from the only one.
后来我发现，她远不是唯一一位这样的老师。

6
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:41,190
Many teachers here stay after class to answer questions, and they read our papers carefully and give detailed comments.
这里的许多老师课后留下来解答问题，他们认真批阅我们的论文，并给出详细的评语。

7
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:47,170
Some even invite undergraduates to join their research projects and guide them step by step.
有些老师甚至邀请本科生参与他们的科研项目，并一步一步地指导他们。

8
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:50,360
Their dedication has influenced me deeply.
他们的全心付出对我影响很深。

9
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:58,670
Seeing how seriously they treat their work, I have learned to be more responsible in my studies and to help classmates whenever they need it.
看到他们对待工作如此认真，我学会了在学习上更有责任心，并在同学需要的时候帮助他们。

10
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:06,460
To me, what makes a university great is not its buildings but its people, and our teachers are the best proof of this.
在我看来，成就一所伟大大学的不是它的建筑，而是它的人，而我们的老师就是最好的证明。
